{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "ESP32 PWM \u00b7 six MOSFETs \u00b7 RGB demonstration",
  "description": "Three PWM-driven low-side RGB LED channels (5V, 330 ohm each), plus three isolated MOSFETs to illustrate six-switch ESC topology. Not a functional three-phase ESC: proper high-side drivers, dead-time, bootstrap and protection required. Virtual circuit only.",
